---
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-[#111213]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        The Cost of <span class="gradient-text">Inaction</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300">
        Every day without a professional website and AI-powered receptionist, your business
        hemorrhages potential revenue and loses customers to competitors who adapted first.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Ghost Town Effect -->
      <div class="bg-slate-bg rounded-3xl p-8 card-shadow hover:card-shadow-lg transition-shadow group text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 gradient-bg rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="text-5xl font-bold gradient-text mb-3">62%</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">The Ghost Town Effect</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Over 62% of incoming small-business calls go completely unanswered due to busy hours,
          understaffing, or after-hours closure. Every missed call is a lost customer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5-Minute Lead Decay -->
      <div class="bg-slate-bg rounded-3xl p-8 card-shadow hover:card-shadow-lg transition-shadow group text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 gradient-bg rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="text-5xl font-bold gradient-text mb-3">80%</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">The 5-Minute Lead Decay</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          A lead that isn't answered or called back within 5 minutes drops in conversion probability
          by 80%. Human teams take an average of 3+ hours to reply, losing the customer instantly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Lost Revenue -->
      <div class="bg-slate-bg rounded-3xl p-8 card-shadow hover:card-shadow-lg transition-shadow group text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 gradient-bg rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="text-5xl font-bold gradient-text mb-3">$8K+</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Lost Revenue Monthly</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Uncaptured phone inquiries equal thousands of dollars in leaked pipelines every month.
          Your competitors with AI receptionists are capturing the leads you're losing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
